===persian===

های... باران... تو می باری...
تا بوی کاهگل را
که فراموش کرده ای
به خاطر آوری باران ببار...
زنی را که دوست دارم
سفر می کند و چون برگردد
مرا از خاطر برده است.

تهران، پاییز ۱۳۶۸

===machine===

Hey... rain... you are raining... to remind you of the smell of straw that you have forgotten . Rain... the woman I love is traveling and when she returns she has forgotten me.

Tehran, Autumn 1989

===translation===

O... rain... you are raining... so that you bring back the smell of adobe that you have forgotten— pour, rain...
The woman I love is traveling, and when she returns she has carried me out of her memory.

